/2026/02/06/plains-gp-pagp-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[1,1,0,1.55],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[6,5,1,9.3],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0227,"r5":0.0014,"r20":0.1232,"r1_spy":-0.0418,"r5_spy":-0.004,"r20_spy":0.1309}},{"id":"PAGP 2026 Q1","t":"PAGP","d":"2026-05-08","time":"10:00","w":4019,"n":29,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/plains-gp-pagp-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[2,2,0,5.08],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[4,3,0,10.15],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0186,"r5":0.0207,"r20":0.0351,"r1_spy":-0.0269,"r5_spy":-0.0019,"r20_spy":0.027}}],"quotes":[{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2018-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"As shown in slide six, we expect our full year 2018 average Permian tariff volumes to increase more than 30% or approximately one million barrels a day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-pagp-q3-2018-e.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2018-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"In total, we expect full year Permian tariff volumes of slightly less than 3.8 million barrels a day, the impacts of the partial BridgeTex sale, and timing of completion activity, are partially offset by the earlier in-service timing of Sunrise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-pagp-q3-2018-e.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2018-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"Our results for the quarter reflect continued growth from our fee-based segments and over performance in our supply and logistics segment, or S&L. We anticipate both of these trends to continue through the fourth quarter and into 2019 as reflected in our updated and increased 2018 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-pagp-q3-2018-e.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2018-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Tonet","x":"And just wondering, is this kind of more front half of they are weighted as far as what you see for S&L and you kind of will lift the guide as they see the prompt couple quarters higher?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-pagp-q3-2018-e.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2019-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"We've finalized joint venture agreements with the Capline owners and Marathon Petroleum Corporation as operator has launched binding open seasons for Capline reversal that would support movements from Patoka to St. James and from Cushing to St. James via a joint tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2018 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2019-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"When the tariffs were implemented we certainly saw a pop-up, but I just don't know exactly where it stands today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Chandler","x":"So it's just necessary for the conversion and conducting an open season to have one tariff and to go to the market with one offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Vikram Bagri","x":"And more broadly, your peers have talked about basin getting over piped, we -- our analysis also shows that on crude side basis, Permian Basin will be over piped for some time and tariffs have been going down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al P. Swanson","x":"But the volume on S&L that you've seen down roughly 85,000 barrels a day is all virtually all NGL and it's the streamlining that Harry mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"The key point on this is we purchased the steel before the tariffs were implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Richardson","x":"And then not to bring up a lightning rod item, but can you talk about just tariff surcharges to the extent that future build-out pipelines, etc. This may be something that you employ when and where the procurement process incurs these costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry N. Pefanis","x":"And we did a lot of work over the last year, streamlining our business and taking some of the volatility out of the business, making more consistent returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al P. Swanson","x":"From 1Q 2017 through 3Q 2019 we nearly doubled our Permian tariff volumes averaging quarterly growth of approximately 230000 barrels per day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al P. Swanson","x":"We expect Cactus II and our total Permian tariff volumes to continue to grow in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"But Sunil of the 2019 and 2020 numbers right there's a timing component a cost savings and an optimization component.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"Most of it's just a business mix and growing volumes on pipes that have lower tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"I mean, we have certain pipes that have tariffs in the $0.20 to $0.30 range and some that are $4 plus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2019 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"We do look at asset sales as being a pretty good tool in the meantime, because we do get some business streamlining and that, we think we -- ultimately that works as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the Transportation segment, our February guidance had assumed 10% volume growth from 2019 with 2020 tariff volumes averaging 7.6 million barrels per day, driven by continued Permian production growth, and in the aggregate, flat to slightly lower production in the remaining U.S. shale basins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"This is Jeremy, I think the way to think about it is, some of the spots capacity could have come off of pipelines and that's obviously higher tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"That said, we continue to challenge all investments in the current environment and are working to capture additional cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q1","e":"pagp","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"The one nuance I want to give you is, when we are doing this, I've been in many different situations where you chase cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"Unit margins have improved, reflecting higher expected average tariff rates and our continued focus on reducing operating costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"I'll note that our updated guidance incorporates the shift between quarters of earnings related to the timing impact of MVC deficiencies relative to billing cycles and the deficiency payments are also contributing to the higher average tariff rate for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"As summarized on Slide 7, we continue to advance initiatives to optimize our asset portfolio and streamline our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"With respect to optimizing our business, we continue to streamline and drive efficiencies across all aspects of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"In addition to increasing guidance for our adjusted EBITDA, we have further reduced our 2020 and 2021 capex program by an additional $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"It's lower guidance for transportation on share volume movements, but EBITDA will reflect that we were paid for the movement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2020-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"…basis, transportation segment results increased over second quarter 2020 results, driven by $25 million timing benefit related to MVC deficiencies that occurred during the second quarter in addition to a modest increase in tariff volumes and continuation of cost optimization initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"We've also made solid progress in our efforts to streamline and drive efficiencies across all aspects of our business and we've realized meaningful cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"We currently expect to realize $125 million a year or more of fixed cost savings that should endure in future years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2020-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"…today's call are provided on Slide 3, which reflects our progress in a number of areas, including raising our 2020 guidance, executing non-core asset sales, providing 2021 preliminary guidance, targeting an additional $600 million or more of asset sales, and progressing our shift to positive…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2020-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the balance of 2020, we currently intend to allocate up to $75 million for repurchases, which effectively equates to the increase 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2021-02-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"So it couldn't yield lower capex outlays in Texas, but all in all, tariffs are somewhat similar between the two regions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2021-02-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"…stay ahead of the production side and so when you think about our system, I know I've shared this before Ujjwal, in the Permian we had roughly 5 million tariff barrels or barrel capacity to and gathering to an intra-base and one in longhaul and we've built that out over the last number of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"First, we have fully embraced our companywide transition to efficiency mode, focusing on streamlining the organization, reducing costs and working to optimize all aspects of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2020 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"We also advanced optimization and efficiency initiatives throughout the year, resulting in more than $125 million of opex and G&A cost savings which we expect to endure in 2021 and future years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"And so that led to more tariff revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"So we've seen out-performance on the tariff side, but less performance on the S&L side, so we view that as a positive trade-off and a natural hedge in our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Chandler","x":"There are a number of moving parts, Tristan, but we continue to challenge the organization to capture cost savings opportunities, and they continue to deliver.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"Financial discipline, not only capex, but maintenance capex, operating capex, I mean, that's really been a tremendous focus of the organization is to streamline and be as efficient as we can.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"This afternoon, we reported better-than-expected second quarter adjusted EBITDA of $579 million, and we increased our full year guidance by $25 million to plus or minus $2.175 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"But I think the uncertainty of what the structure looks like and what they can offer is precient relative to adding additional joint tariffs with third-party.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"So a person can opt to send that up to Cushing, which we would get the benefit of the tariff, and we would then have a little bit more noise on the transportation side on -- if a barrel didn't flow, we still get paid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2021 Q3","e":"pagp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"And to your second question, I think there's a number of projects potentially restructuring how crude gets across the Canadian border and what markets it goes to.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/plains-gp-holdings-lp-pagp-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAGP 2025 Q2","e":"pagp","d":"2025-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"This move not only increases our financial flexibility, but it also underscores our resolve to streamline operations and drive growth while generating strong returns for our unitholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/08/plains-gp-pagp-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAGP 2025 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2026-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wilfred C.W. Chiang","x":"The market environment presented multiple challenges, including geopolitical unrest, actions from OPEC to increase oil supply, and uncertainty on the economic impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/plains-gp-pagp-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAGP 2025 Q4","e":"pagp","d":"2026-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wilfred C.W. Chiang","x":"As highlighted on Slide four, despite these distractions, we remain focused on transitioning to a pure-play crude company, which also serves as a catalyst 